      "value": "resonite does this, it's awesome. i would buy things on the creator marketplace if i could spawn them into any world with any avatar. even if it's just for friends+ worlds and disabled in all publics (i believe that's how it should work to be honest) i would buy a vrchat gizmo if given the opportunity, i'm sure others would also.\n\neven if there were only \"gizmos\" directly made by the vrchat team for performance reasons it would still be insanely cool and such a new opportunity for less technical individuals who don't want to load an avatar into unity, add a thing pulled from gumroad, do whatever other shenanigans involved, summon a demon.",
